    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Protogen Engineer tells the story of Marwen, a Protogen mercenary who almost died on his last mission. Gladly, his teammates brought him to the only person who could save him - Xena. Being a very talented engineer, Xena saved Marwen's brain and transplanted it into a functional mechanical body. Now he has to adapt to his new life and find a new purpose, a new meaning to his life. But at least he's not alone, Xena will be there to help him!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Marwen and Xena on this journey, find more about their common past and just spend time together with them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-story happening in &quot;My Furry Protogen&quot; universe. If you would like to know more about it, check out the original games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cute female protogen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 HD fully original artworks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relaxing atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Some personal drama, as usual.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Protogen Engineer tells the story of Marwen, a Protogen mercenary who almost died on his last mission. Gladly, his teammates brought him to the only person who could save him - Xena. Being a very talented engineer, Xena saved Marwen's brain and transplanted it into a functional mechanical body. Now he has to adapt to his new life and find a new purpose, a new meaning to his life. But at least he's not alone, Xena will be there to help him!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Marwen and Xena on this journey, find more about their common past and just spend time together with them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-story happening in &quot;My Furry Protogen&quot; universe. If you would like to know more about it, check out the original games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cute female protogen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 HD fully original artworks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relaxing atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Some personal drama, as usual.</p>",
